{
  "$defs": {
    "ConnectHint": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "An accepted autoconnect hint, as an explicit connection (ADR-0007: autoconnect is an editing aid; the\ncommand carries the result).",
      "properties": {
        "cp": {
          "description": "The symbol CP of the new representation (`SymbolCp.idx`).",
          "format": "uint16",
          "maximum": 65535,
          "minimum": 0,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "to": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/EndpointParam",
          "description": "The other end: a CP or a junction."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "cp",
        "to"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "DeviceKind": {
      "description": "A device's UI and numbering hint. Doc 03 enumerates only these kinds so far; others are kept as\n[`DeviceKind::Unknown`] until the list is decided.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "psu",
          "description": "Power supply.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "terminal",
          "description": "Terminal.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "blanking_plate",
          "description": "Blank manifold or valve-terminal position (doc 11 §2.7).",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    "EndpointParam": {
      "description": "An endpoint named in command parameters: a function CP, a junction, or a point on an existing\nconnection (which splits it and creates a junction there, doc 06 §3.5).\n\nJSON: `{\"cp\": {\"function\": \"…\", \"idx\": 1}}`, `{\"junction\": {\"junction\": \"…\"}}`,\n`{\"on_connection\": {\"connection\": \"…\", \"at\": [x, y]}}`.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Connection point `idx` of a function.",
          "properties": {
            "cp": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "function": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid",
                  "description": "The function."
                },
                "idx": {
                  "description": "The CP index.",
                  "format": "uint16",
                  "maximum": 65535,
                  "minimum": 0,
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "function",
                "idx"
              ],
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "cp"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "A junction.",
          "properties": {
            "junction": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "junction": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid",
                  "description": "The junction."
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "junction"
              ],
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "junction"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "A point on an existing connection's route.",
          "properties": {
            "on_connection": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "at": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/Pt2",
                  "description": "The point (on the route, if the connection has one)."
                },
                "connection": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid",
                  "description": "The connection to split."
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "connection",
                "at"
              ],
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "on_connection"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    },
    "FnRole": {
      "description": "Main or auxiliary function.",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "main",
          "description": "The main function (the default).",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "aux",
          "description": "An auxiliary function.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Ident": {
      "description": "An identifier: non-empty, one line, NFC, without leading or trailing white space (doc 05 §3.2).",
      "minLength": 1,
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Orient2": {
      "description": "Orientation: rotation clockwise on the sheet, optionally mirrored (doc 05 §3.2).",
      "enum": [
        "r0",
        "r90",
        "r180",
        "r270",
        "m0",
        "m90",
        "m180",
        "m270"
      ],
      "type": "string"
    },
    "PlaceTarget": {
      "description": "Which device a placed representation belongs to (doc 06 §3.3).",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "A new device with a new main function; its counter comes from online numbering.",
          "properties": {
            "new_device": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "fndef": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ],
                  "description": "The FnDef copy; default the copy the symbol's `fndef` resolves to."
                },
                "kind": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/DeviceKind"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ],
                  "description": "UI and numbering hint."
                },
                "letter": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/Ident",
                  "description": "The letter code (the identifier-set lookup from the FnDef category is WP-S1.11)."
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "letter"
              ],
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "new_device"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Another representation of an existing function (FR-DEV-003).",
          "properties": {
            "existing_function": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "function": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid",
                  "description": "The function."
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "function"
              ],
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "existing_function"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "A new function of an existing device (FR-DEV-038).",
          "properties": {
            "join_device": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "device": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid",
                  "description": "The device."
                },
                "fndef": {
                  "anyOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    }
                  ],
                  "description": "The FnDef copy; default the copy the symbol's `fndef` resolves to."
                },
                "role": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/FnRole",
                  "default": "aux",
                  "description": "The role; default auxiliary."
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "device"
              ],
              "type": "object"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "join_device"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Pt2": {
      "description": "A point or a displacement [x, y] in nanometres, y downwards (doc 05 §3.2).",
      "items": false,
      "maxItems": 2,
      "minItems": 2,
      "prefixItems": [
        {
          "maximum": 9007199254740991,
          "minimum": -9007199254740991,
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "maximum": 9007199254740991,
          "minimum": -9007199254740991,
          "type": "integer"
        }
      ],
      "type": "array"
    },
    "RepType": {
      "description": "Representation types (doc 03 §6, doc 07 §2.3). `panel_front` is a symbol type only: panel-front\nrepresentations are derived, never stored (ADR-0006 amendment 3).",
      "oneOf": [
        {
          "const": "multi_line",
          "description": "Multi-line (the default).",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "single_line",
          "description": "Single-line.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "overview",
          "description": "Overview.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "fluid",
          "description": "Fluid.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "topology",
          "description": "Bus topology.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "contact_image",
          "description": "Contact image.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "panel_front",
          "description": "Panel front (symbol graphics only).",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "strip_segment",
          "description": "Strip segment.",
          "type": "string"
        },
        {
          "const": "graphic",
          "description": "Graphic.",
          "type": "string"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Uuid": {
      "description": "A lower-case hyphenated UUID naming a record (doc 05 §3.2).",
      "maxLength": 36,
      "minLength": 36,
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "`device.place` (`PlaceSymbol`, doc 06 §3.3): places a symbol and creates the device and function as the\ntarget requires.\n\n- The page and the symbol copy must exist. The representation is `{functions: [f], page, symbol,\n  variant, pos, orient, rep_type}`; `rep_type` defaults to the symbol's.\n- `new_device`: a device `{tag: {letter, counter: none}, kind}` and a main function `{def}`; `def` is\n  `fndef` or the FnDef copy `v5(NS_LIBCOPY, library ‖ item)` of the symbol's `fndef` reference, which\n  must be embedded (else rejected with a hint to pass `fndef`).\n- `existing_function`: the function must exist and must not be an interruption point (`ip.place`).\n- `join_device`: a new function of the device with the given role (a second main function is rejected\n  by EW-INV-002).\n- Every hint creates a wire `{a: the hint's CP, b: to, page}` without a route; the hint's symbol CP is\n  mapped to a function CP as the derived pin map does (`(functions[0], fn_cp)`); an unknown symbol CP\n  or a point on a connection as `to` is rejected. A hint ending at a junction appends the wire to the\n  junction's sequence.\n\nOnline numbering (normaliser #4) gives a new device its counter; a symbol dropped onto a wire splits it\n(normaliser #7). Outcome: the representation. Aliases `device.place_from_part`, `symbol.place`.",
  "properties": {
    "connect": {
      "description": "Accepted autoconnect hints.",
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/ConnectHint"
      },
      "type": "array"
    },
    "orient": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Orient2",
      "default": "r0",
      "description": "The orientation."
    },
    "page": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid",
      "description": "The page."
    },
    "pos": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Pt2",
      "description": "The insertion point."
    },
    "rep_type": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/RepType"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The representation type; default the symbol's."
    },
    "symbol": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Uuid",
      "description": "The symbol copy."
    },
    "target": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/PlaceTarget",
      "description": "Which device the representation belongs to."
    },
    "variant": {
      "default": 0,
      "description": "The stored contact-image or CP variant.",
      "format": "uint8",
      "maximum": 255,
      "minimum": 0,
      "type": "integer"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "page",
    "symbol",
    "pos",
    "target"
  ],
  "title": "device.place",
  "type": "object"
}
